Entity filtering options
Filter Logic for Sole Traders Search
	•	Entity type, status, and date range can be combined or used independently
	•	Supported filter combinations:
	◦	Entity type only (e.g. sole traders, all statuses)
	◦	Status only (e.g. passed, referred)
	◦	Date range only (created on or completed on)
	◦	Any combination of the above
	•	Date field selection via dropdown: “Created Date” or “Completed Date”
	◦	Default: created on, if nothing selected
	◦	From/to applies to whichever field is chosen
Date Range Handling
	•	If only “from date” is provided, treat “to date” as current timestamp (latest)
	•	If both from and to are the same date, filter to that specific date only
	•	Backend handles missing “to date” gracefully, no hard requirement on both fields
